WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.866 --> 00:00:05.466
Yeah! There it is.

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:08.766
Awesome. Kalos League, here we come.

3
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.200
Pika!

4
00:00:10.266 --> 00:00:12.733
Ash has won his eighth Kalos Gym badge,

5
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.266
and now our heroes have arrived in Lumiose City, site of the Kalos League.

6
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.300
This is where Ash's greatest challenge yet is about to begin.

7
00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:25.833
The entire city of Lumiose is celebrating the Kalos League.

8
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:27.800
The city is bustling

9
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:30.533
and fans are eagerly waiting for it to begin.

10
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:35.033
I'm Malva, and I'll be covering the Kalos League.

11
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:40.033
This would be a great opportunity to interview a trainer in the tournament.

12
00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:44.966
Remind me not to be on a TV crew again.

13
00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:48.966
This will be a golden opportunity to steal some great Pokémon.

14
00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.266
Now there are more than I can count.

15
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.900
In the meantime, let's earn a little cash.

16
00:00:53.966 --> 00:00:56.233
A great way to get food and Pokémon.

17
00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:57.733
Agh!

18
00:00:58.333 --> 00:00:59.933
Keep it steady down there.

19
00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:01.266
Wobbuffet.

20
00:01:02.366 --> 00:01:05.633
- Wow! It's huge.
- So many people, too.

21
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.100
And to think we're finally here.

22
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.933
Where Ash's battle of all battles takes place.

23
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:14.600
Yeah. Along with tons of strong trainers and Pokémon.

24
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.700
I'm excited just thinking about it. You, too?

25
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.066
Pika.

26
00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:20.600
Excuse me.

27
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:25.133
- Are you competing in the Kalos League?
- Uh, that's right.

28
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.333
- Will you let me interview you?
- You wanna interview me?

29
00:01:29.533 --> 00:01:31.100
She found the twerp.

30
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:32.566
Rotten twerp luck.

31
00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.366
Roll the camera.

32
00:01:35.533 --> 00:01:36.766
Your name, please?

33
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:39.600
It's Ash. I'm Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town.

34
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:44.100
- Tell me what you hope to accomplish.
- Sure. I'm here so I can win it all.

35
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:48.466
Battle by battle, step by step, I'll be the Kalos League champ.

36
00:01:49.466 --> 00:01:50.733
Well, you asked.

37
00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.466
You heard it here first. A declaration of victory.

38
00:01:54.533 --> 00:01:55.700
Good luck, Ash.

39
00:01:55.966 --> 00:01:57.100
Thanks a lot.

40
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.300
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

41
00:02:09.066 --> 00:02:12.233
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

42
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:16.133
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

43
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.800
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

44
00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.366
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

45
00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:23.700
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

46
00:02:23.766 --> 00:02:26.933
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

47
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.666
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

48
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.033
Better hurry, Ash, or you're not gonna be able to register in time.

49
00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.033
So many people are stopping to wish me good luck.

50
00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:46.933
Hold up.

51
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.833
So, since you've already decided you're the winner, show me how strong you are.

52
00:02:52.466 --> 00:02:54.200
Let's have a battle.

53
00:02:56.333 --> 00:03:00.900
Wow. A Furfrou. Perfect timing. This will be my pre-league--

54
00:03:00.966 --> 00:03:02.600
There's no time for that.

55
00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:04.900
- You've got to register.
- Uh...

56
00:03:04.966 --> 00:03:08.900
We're sorry, but thing is, registration is going to close soon.

57
00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:11.100
I hope you'll excuse us.

58
00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:12.233
No time to waste.

59
00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.133
Sorry. Next time. Promise.

60
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.466
What will you do if you miss registration?

61
00:03:17.533 --> 00:03:19.300
You can be such a kid.

62
00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:27.666
So close.

63
00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:30.166
Yeah, but we made it just in time.

64
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:32.666
Just think.

65
00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:35.300
Everyone here has won lots of gym battles.

66
00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:37.533
This will be great.

67
00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.666
I can't wait to battle them.

68
00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:49.366
Just watch. I'm gonna do it. No doubt I'll get my eighth gym badge here.

69
00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:51.533
We'll battle at the Kalos League.

70
00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.866
I'm gonna break my losing streak.

71
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.166
- And then you and I will even the score.
- Yeah. You're on, Ash.

72
00:04:04.566 --> 00:04:06.100
I knew he'd make it here.

73
00:04:06.266 --> 00:04:10.300
I've been looking up to him for so long and he didn't disappoint.

74
00:04:13.266 --> 00:04:15.700
- Aah!
- Hey, Ash. Good to see you.

75
00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:17.100
It's Tierno.

76
00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:19.333
- Nice to see you, Ash.
- Trevor, too.

77
00:04:19.399 --> 00:04:21.566
- How's it going?
- Just fine, Bonnie.

78
00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:24.533
And seeing you is the best ever.

79
00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.600
Thanks a lot.

80
00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:28.600
Trevor and I watched you in the Pokémon Showcase.

81
00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:29.900
You were so good.

82
00:04:29.966 --> 00:04:31.033
Thanks, Tierno.

83
00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:32.666
I didn't manage to become queen.

84
00:04:33.633 --> 00:04:35.900
But you'll always be a queen to me.

85
00:04:35.966 --> 00:04:38.200
Uh--! So, where's Shauna?

86
00:04:38.266 --> 00:04:40.300
She said she's coming later.

87
00:04:40.466 --> 00:04:41.566
That's great.

88
00:04:41.733 --> 00:04:43.200
Are you guys competing?

89
00:04:43.266 --> 00:04:46.333
I sure am. I'm gonna win the whole competition.

90
00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:49.200
Oh, yeah? I'm gonna win the whole thing, too.

91
00:04:49.633 --> 00:04:51.333
Great. So am I.

92
00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.966
Professor Sycamore and Alain.

93
00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:05.700
Alain!

94
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:10.233
I'm competing. Are you, too?

95
00:05:10.933 --> 00:05:13.533
Yeah. Because I wanna battle against you.

96
00:05:13.966 --> 00:05:14.800
Really?

97
00:05:15.266 --> 00:05:17.533
There's the matter of Mega Evolution energy, too.

98
00:05:18.366 --> 00:05:20.900
For now, my goal is to keep on advancing.

99
00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:25.333
- You make sure you do the same thing.
- I will. No way I'll lose.

100
00:05:25.766 --> 00:05:27.966
The point is to win the whole thing.

101
00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:36.233
Ladies and gentlemen,

102
00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.400
we will announce the matchups for the first round.

103
00:05:43.966 --> 00:05:47.400
Up on the monitor, there you have them.

104
00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.233
First-round matchups.

105
00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.133
Wow! First up are Trevor and Alain.

106
00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.266
Mm-hm.

107
00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.200
Ash, you're in the second battle.

108
00:06:02.266 --> 00:06:04.300
I wonder who my opponent is.

109
00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.233
I'm in battle 23. All right!

110
00:06:15.066 --> 00:06:17.066
Best of luck, everyone.

111
00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.133
Oh, man. The first battle.

112
00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.133
You'll be fine, Trevor. With your secret weapon.

113
00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:25.666
Yeah. I know, but still.

114
00:06:25.733 --> 00:06:28.166
Hey, awesome. What's your secret weapon?

115
00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:33.400
Can't say. If I were to tell you, it wouldn't be a surprise, now, would it?

116
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:35.666
Come on, tell me already.

117
00:06:35.833 --> 00:06:37.166
Do you know, Tierno?

118
00:06:37.566 --> 00:06:40.433
- Huh? Me?
- Keep it a secret until tomorrow.

119
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.766
I might have to battle Ash, you know.

120
00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:54.933
A beautiful, clear blue sky marks the beginning of this event.

121
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.500
The Kalos League is on.

122
00:06:58.766 --> 00:07:00.933
First up, our opening ceremony.

123
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:04.700
Kalos Champion Diantha will deliver the opening speech.

124
00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.000
To all our trainers...

125
00:07:12.066 --> 00:07:16.433
your efforts and experiences are treasures that will always be with you.

126
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.166
Now is the time to put all of it to the test.

127
00:07:19.233 --> 00:07:22.666
Kalos League demands that you give everything you've got,

128
00:07:22.733 --> 00:07:25.733
and demonstrate all your hard work and dedication.

129
00:07:26.633 --> 00:07:30.600
It is my great honor to declare this year's Kalos League...

130
00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:32.266
open!

131
00:07:39.466 --> 00:07:43.066
The two trainers competing in this opening battle are Trevor

132
00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:44.833
and Alain.

133
00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:52.300
The battle format will be three-on-three until the semifinals.

134
00:07:52.366 --> 00:07:55.666
In addition, the battlefield will be randomly selected.

135
00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.266
So, the field for our opening battle is...

136
00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.633
a water and rock battlefield.

137
00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:09.766
Trainers, please bring out your Pokémon.

138
00:08:12.466 --> 00:08:14.200
Charizard, come on out.

139
00:08:17.366 --> 00:08:21.333
- That's amazing. His Charmeleon evolved.
- Now for Alain's choice.

140
00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.266
Charizard, let's go.

141
00:08:28.733 --> 00:08:31.833
Wow, both trainers are using Charizard.

142
00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.100
Without a doubt, guaranteed to be a memorable battle.

143
00:08:41.933 --> 00:08:45.400
Now, which Charizard will make the first move?

144
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:50.333
I'll make the first move, if you won't. All right, Charizard, fire spin.

145
00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.333
Dodge it, Charizard.

146
00:08:57.566 --> 00:08:58.633
Now, flamethrower.

147
00:09:00.233 --> 00:09:01.600
Use dragon claw.

148
00:09:08.266 --> 00:09:10.900
Okay, time to show off right from the start.

149
00:09:10.966 --> 00:09:12.933
Let's get to it, Charizard.

150
00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.300
Trevor's Charizard has just Mega Evolved.

151
00:09:37.366 --> 00:09:39.633
- Wow!
- So, the secret weapon

152
00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.566
Trevor mentioned yesterday was Mega Evolution.

153
00:09:42.633 --> 00:09:47.633
Mm? That surprises you? Trevor's been training really hard for the Kalos League.

154
00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.433
My Mega Charizard's ability is drought.

155
00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.633
You'll be hit with extra powerful fire-type moves,

156
00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:55.733
so get ready.

157
00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.100
Charizard, heat wave.

158
00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:02.600
Quickly, splash water.

159
00:10:05.933 --> 00:10:08.600
Alain blocks with water. Quick thinking.

160
00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:11.366
- That's Alain for you.
- Pika.

161
00:10:11.433 --> 00:10:13.933
Using the field to his advantage.

162
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.366
Charizard, keep up the pressure.

163
00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.200
Use dragon tail.

164
00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:22.100
Now dodge it.

165
00:10:24.766 --> 00:10:27.633
The entire stadium is feeling the heat, too.

166
00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.566
Right. There's no holding back.

167
00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.833
Respond to my heart. Now, Key Stone.

168
00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:36.000
Beyond evolution. Mega Evolve!

169
00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.900
- There it is.
- Alain's got a secret weapon, too.

170
00:10:56.333 --> 00:10:59.900
This bout has now turned into a Mega Charizard battle.

171
00:10:59.966 --> 00:11:03.600
Who could've imagined the first battle of the Kalos League

172
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:05.933
would turn out to be this incredible?

173
00:11:06.366 --> 00:11:08.500
Who's that Pokémon?

174
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.200
It's Charizard.

175
00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.233
Now, Charizard, use fire spin.

176
00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.133
Use flamethrower.

177
00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.333
The smoke is blocking our view.

178
00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:34.633
What in the world's happening inside that smoke cloud?

179
00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.200
Charizard, fly up.

180
00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:43.500
Trevor's Charizard is flying above the smoke cloud.

181
00:11:44.633 --> 00:11:46.966
Straight ahead. Angle, 53 degrees.

182
00:11:47.033 --> 00:11:48.133
Use flamethrower.

183
00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:53.466
Charizard, no!

184
00:12:01.433 --> 00:12:03.833
Trevor's Charizard is unable to battle.

185
00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:07.233
Alain's Charizard is the winner!

186
00:12:10.733 --> 00:12:11.733
That's that.

187
00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.233
An attack that intense needs a really strong bond

188
00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.866
between trainer and Pokémon to coordinate.

189
00:12:17.933 --> 00:12:19.233
Really strong.

190
00:12:19.666 --> 00:12:22.833
Huh? Hey, Ash, I think you'd better get going now.

191
00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:23.733
Right.

192
00:12:24.166 --> 00:12:25.566
Lots of luck, Ash.

193
00:12:25.633 --> 00:12:27.166
Go show them who's boss.

194
00:12:27.233 --> 00:12:29.300
We'll all be here cheering you on.

195
00:12:29.366 --> 00:12:32.833
- Yeah, show them how to battle.
- I will. Thanks, you guys.

196
00:12:43.133 --> 00:12:45.266
Aerodactyl, let's go.

197
00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:52.433
Trevor's second Pokémon is Aerodactyl.

198
00:12:53.833 --> 00:12:55.500
- So, we meet again.
- Huh?

199
00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.500
Let's have a battle.

200
00:12:57.566 --> 00:13:00.600
- But I've got a battle out there.
- You promised.

201
00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:04.000
Sorry. Next time. Promise.

202
00:13:04.733 --> 00:13:06.100
Running away again?

203
00:13:06.733 --> 00:13:07.966
Pika, pika.

204
00:13:08.266 --> 00:13:10.466
I know, but I did say the next time.

205
00:13:10.533 --> 00:13:11.800
Pika. Pika!

206
00:13:11.866 --> 00:13:13.333
I'm keeping my word.

207
00:13:15.733 --> 00:13:17.066
I have to do it.

208
00:13:17.133 --> 00:13:20.933
That's what I wanna hear from a trainer who's won eight badges.

209
00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.233
One-on-one battle, no holding back.

210
00:13:26.566 --> 00:13:27.733
Let's do this.

211
00:13:28.266 --> 00:13:29.500
Pikachu.

212
00:13:29.566 --> 00:13:31.200
Who cares about badges?

213
00:13:31.266 --> 00:13:34.133
I'm going to beat you and prove how strong I am.

214
00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.066
Furfrou, sand attack.

215
00:13:39.666 --> 00:13:42.566
- Oh, no!
- There are lots of strong trainers.

216
00:13:42.633 --> 00:13:44.866
Trainers without eight badges.

217
00:13:45.266 --> 00:13:48.033
Now, Furfrou, giga impact, go.

218
00:13:50.366 --> 00:13:51.433
Dodge it, Pikachu!

219
00:13:53.266 --> 00:13:54.200
Aerodactyl.

220
00:13:54.266 --> 00:13:55.333
Aerodactyl!

221
00:13:55.966 --> 00:13:58.200
Aerodactyl is unable to battle.

222
00:13:58.266 --> 00:13:59.300
Are you okay?

223
00:13:59.733 --> 00:14:00.700
Pikachu.

224
00:14:01.433 --> 00:14:04.133
- Pika.
- Furfrou, now. Take down.

225
00:14:04.666 --> 00:14:06.333
Pikachu, iron tail.

226
00:14:11.066 --> 00:14:12.900
Keep it up. Electro ball.

227
00:14:13.533 --> 00:14:15.666
Furfrou, use cotton guard.

228
00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:23.966
That was close.

229
00:14:24.666 --> 00:14:26.200
You're strong, all right.

230
00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.900
But I'm just gonna have to beat you, so I can get out there.

231
00:14:31.533 --> 00:14:34.666
I didn't make it to the Kalos League for nothing.

232
00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:39.800
I've got a lot of memories associated with each and every gym badge I've won.

233
00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:44.166
Get ready for this.

234
00:14:44.233 --> 00:14:47.100
- I'll show you what they all mean.
- Pikachu.

235
00:14:47.533 --> 00:14:49.566
Florges!

236
00:14:53.433 --> 00:14:54.466
Florges.

237
00:14:56.566 --> 00:14:59.500
Alain's Mega Charizard nails that Flamethrower.

238
00:14:59.566 --> 00:15:00.533
Florges!

239
00:15:01.766 --> 00:15:05.566
Florges is unable to battle. Charizard wins.

240
00:15:05.633 --> 00:15:09.033
Which means the winner is Alain.

241
00:15:09.733 --> 00:15:12.700
And Alain grabs the first win of the league.

242
00:15:13.466 --> 00:15:15.833
Showing us he's a cut above.

243
00:15:20.333 --> 00:15:21.966
Well, I guess it's over.

244
00:15:22.333 --> 00:15:23.800
My Kalos League's done.

245
00:15:26.966 --> 00:15:29.033
Moving on to the next battle.

246
00:15:29.466 --> 00:15:33.200
Presenting Titus and Ash.

247
00:15:38.866 --> 00:15:40.800
The next battlefield?

248
00:15:41.366 --> 00:15:44.033
It's covered in grass.

249
00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.333
Uh...? What's going on here?

250
00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.533
Ash has yet to appear on the battlefield.

251
00:15:50.966 --> 00:15:54.566
- What? What now?
- Something must've happened along the way.

252
00:15:54.633 --> 00:15:58.366
- What if he doesn't show up?
- His opponent will win by default

253
00:15:58.433 --> 00:16:01.700
and Ash's Kalos League will be over before it starts.

254
00:16:03.033 --> 00:16:05.766
Does that twerp think he's got better things to do?

255
00:16:05.833 --> 00:16:08.166
What a dumb way to throw in the towel.

256
00:16:08.233 --> 00:16:11.100
Completely caving in the crunch. What nerve.

257
00:16:13.266 --> 00:16:15.766
Will Titus win by default?

258
00:16:18.933 --> 00:16:22.100
- Time is up, which means Ash has--
- Wait, wait!

259
00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.600
- I'm sorry.
- Pika, pika!

260
00:16:24.666 --> 00:16:27.700
I'm Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town, and I'm here.

261
00:16:28.133 --> 00:16:29.100
There he is.

262
00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.733
Thank goodness. I could do without the stress, though.

263
00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:36.133
If he could just be a little more on top of things.

264
00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.400
Twerp time!

265
00:16:37.466 --> 00:16:41.266
Well, well, Ash finally makes his appearance.

266
00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:44.500
And not a moment too soon, I must say.

267
00:16:48.033 --> 00:16:49.800
All right, quick attack.

268
00:16:49.866 --> 00:16:52.100
Here goes. Use cotton guard.

269
00:16:55.433 --> 00:16:56.433
That's quick.

270
00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.933
Let's finish this with thunderbolt.

271
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.766
Pikachu!

272
00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.333
Furfrou, no!

273
00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.733
Thank you for the battle.

274
00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.033
You really beat me.

275
00:17:19.533 --> 00:17:22.033
I couldn't get all eight badges in time.

276
00:17:24.166 --> 00:17:25.266
The thing is...

277
00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:30.133
there are lots of trainers like me who wanted to compete here.

278
00:17:31.233 --> 00:17:35.333
All those trainers with all their dreams and all their hopes.

279
00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.500
You better win, no matter what.

280
00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.266
I'll win, all right.

281
00:17:41.333 --> 00:17:42.666
Pika!

282
00:17:46.966 --> 00:17:49.233
I'm Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town.

283
00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:52.766
I wanna become a Pokémon Master.

284
00:17:53.033 --> 00:17:56.733
That means... win the Kalos League.

285
00:17:58.166 --> 00:18:01.266
There it is. A declaration of victory.

286
00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:05.766
Now, let's see what kind of battle Ash has in store for us.

287
00:18:05.833 --> 00:18:07.500
Altaria, let's go.

288
00:18:09.633 --> 00:18:11.900
- Altaria.
- Altaria, huh?

289
00:18:12.433 --> 00:18:14.766
Pikachu, you get some rest, okay?

290
00:18:14.966 --> 00:18:15.866
Pika.

291
00:18:16.666 --> 00:18:19.233
Greninja, I choose you.

292
00:18:21.933 --> 00:18:24.800
Now, second battle, begin!

293
00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.633
Altaria, use dragon pulse.

294
00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.200
Greninja's hit with a dragon pulse.

295
00:18:39.266 --> 00:18:41.766
- Greninja, you okay?
- Greninja.

296
00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.900
Altaria, draco meteor!

297
00:18:44.333 --> 00:18:46.800
Altaria!

298
00:18:48.166 --> 00:18:50.966
Wow, an especially powerful draco meteor.

299
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:52.633
Is this it for Greninja?

300
00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.266
Yeah? Let's bring out everything we've got.

301
00:18:55.333 --> 00:19:00.866
- Stronger and even stronger. Here we go!
- Greninja! Greninja!

302
00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.633
Greninja!

303
00:19:21.366 --> 00:19:22.433
All right!

304
00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.433
Ash had a secret weapon, too. Awesome.

305
00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:29.200
What's going on? Greninja changed.

306
00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.833
So, they mastered it.

307
00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:33.533
Greninja, water shuriken.

308
00:19:37.566 --> 00:19:38.766
Altaria!

309
00:19:40.566 --> 00:19:42.500
Altaria is unable to battle.

310
00:19:42.566 --> 00:19:44.566
Greninja's the winner.

311
00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.833
Ash and Greninja have taken their first win.

312
00:19:49.166 --> 00:19:52.733
Looks like an unexpected new star trainer has appeared.

313
00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:54.266
Wow! Ash did it.

314
00:19:54.533 --> 00:19:58.200
- Ash and Greninja are so cool.
- He's got two more wins to go.

315
00:19:58.266 --> 00:20:01.633
All right. Let's wrap this thing up as quick as we can.

316
00:20:02.766 --> 00:20:05.866
That's great. I'm glad they finally figured it out.

317
00:20:06.066 --> 00:20:09.266
Shuriken on Greninja's back is proof of its strength.

318
00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.533
But I haven't just been twiddling my thumbs.

319
00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.766
I'll hit Ash with all I've got.

320
00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.100
The Kalos League has just begun.

321
00:20:30.933 --> 00:20:34.766
And with much on his mind, Ash advances to the next round.

322
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.633
So, which opponents await him next?

323
00:20:38.466 --> 00:20:42.966
The answer to come as the journey continues.
